Subject: [PATCH 12/31] fix(host): send unicode text as down/up per UTF-16 unit

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 cmake/compile_definitions/common.cmake |  2 ++
 src/orbit/unicode_events.cpp           | 36 +++++++++++++++++++++
 src/orbit/unicode_events.h             | 44 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/platform/windows/input.cpp         | 20 ++++--------
 tests/unit/test_orbit_unicode.cpp      | 42 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 131 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/orbit/unicode_events.cpp
 create mode 100644 src/orbit/unicode_events.h
 create mode 100644 tests/unit/test_orbit_unicode.cpp

